          "value": "DataContainer/Cell Feature Data/BoxQueryBounds",
          "version": 1
        },
        "parameters_version": 2
      },
      "comments": "Shift all six physical endpoints by half the supplied 0.25 micrometer spacing to form cell-interior query coordinates. The statistics filter floors both endpoints and clips to the image, recovering the intended half-open voxel interval without float32 edge-rounding loss. These query coordinates are not feature extents; raw bounds remain unchanged.",
      "filter": {
        "name": "nx::core::ArrayCalculatorFilter",
        "uuid": "eea49b17-0db2-5bbc-80ef-f44249cc8d55"
      },
      "isDisabled": false
    },
